Package: symbolic
Title: Computer Algebra System for Symbolic Functional Manipulation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Mitchell",
             family = "O'Hara-Wild",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "mail@mitchelloharawild.com",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6729-7695")))
Description: Symbolic differentiation, integration and equation solving for R
    functions. Ordinary R functions are manipulated algebraically and the
    results are returned as R functions, which can be evaluated or transformed
    further. Symbolic algebra is performed by the 'Maxima' computer algebra
    system via the 'maxima' package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/mitchelloharawild/symbolic
